From aa162cdecbd96d81f22c799e6605510794e3bdc8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 05:50:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): preserve model-neutral admission and
 unknown-author refusal [daveey]

Origin receipt serialization captured validator function imports through locals; use an explicit wire-field allowlist. Same-card review previously fell through to a class with no concrete author; fail closed exactly as downstream review does. Legacy selectors also blocked quota alternates, and class pacing consulted the dispatcher registry rather than the assignee registry. Preserve original routing source and all pool gates.

Proof: pre-fix courier and missing-author regression failures reproduced; both consumers now 45 passed. Six saved quota/pacing consumers exercised twice, remaining failures retained for bounded follow-up; this commit is publication, not readiness or landing. Full scripts/check passes.
